---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Container from "../components/Container.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import { site } from "../config/site";

const updated = "5 November 2026";
---

<Base
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description={`How ${site.name} collects and uses the details you send through this site.`}
>
	<Section space="tight">
		<Container size="narrow">
			<div class="page-intro">
				<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
				<p>Last updated {updated}. This page explains what we collect and why.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="prose legal">
				<h2>What we collect</h2>
				<p>
					When you send the free trial form we collect the student name, email address, phone
					number if you provide one, course and plan preference, time zone or preferred times,
					and any message you add. If you subscribe to the newsletter, we collect your email
					address.
				</p>

				<h2>Why we use it</h2>
				<p>
					We use these details to reply to your trial request, arrange lessons, answer
					questions and send the newsletter you asked for. We do not sell your details.
				</p>

				<h2>Where it is stored</h2>
				<p>
					Form submissions are stored in a Cloudflare D1 database and the site is served from
					Cloudflare. Access is limited to the people who arrange lessons and run the site.
				</p>

				<h2>Forms and security</h2>
				<p>
					Forms use server-side validation, a hidden spam trap, rate limiting and Cloudflare
					Turnstile where it is configured. These checks help protect the site and your
					details.
				</p>

				<h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
				<p>
					The site stores your light or dark theme choice in your browser. It does not use
					advertising cookies. If analytics are added later, this page will say so.
				</p>

				<h2>Your choices</h2>
				<p>
					You can ask us to correct or delete the details you have sent. Email{" "}
					<a href={site.emailHref}>{site.email}</a> or call{" "}
					<a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.
				</p>
			</div>
		</Container>
	</Section>
</Base>

<style>
	.legal {
		margin-top: var(--space-xl);
	}
</style>
